{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22381","headline":"叹常生 · 白居易","name":"叹常生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西村常氏子，卧疾不须臾。\n前旬犹访我，今日忽云殂。\n时我病多暇，与之同野居。\n园林青蔼蔼，相去数里余。\n村邻无好客，所遇唯农夫。\n之子何如者，往还犹胜无。\n於今亦已矣，可爲一长吁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}